{%- comment -%}
  templates/page.our-story.liquid — Brand Story

  Reached from three places, all pointing at /pages/our-story:
    templates/index.liquid  "Read Our Full Story"  (brand story band)
    templates/index.liquid  "Our story"            (Try at Home band)
    layout/theme.liquid     "Our Story"            (main navigation)

  The copy below is the brand's own, held in the template rather than in
  the page body so its structure survives — the pillars, the atelier steps
  and the pull quote each need their own markup, and a rich-text field in
  admin would flatten all three into plain paragraphs.

  To edit the words: change them here. Anything typed into the page body in
  admin renders as an extra passage after the introduction, so admin edits
  are additive rather than a silent override.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="story-page">

  {%- comment -%} ============ HERO ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-hero">
    <div class="story-hero__inner container">
      <p class="pv-eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1 class="story-hero__title">Jewellery Woven With <em>Legacy</em></h1>
      <p class="story-hero__kicker">Crafted By Hand. Worn For Generations.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="story-hero__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ============ INTRODUCTION ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-intro container" aria-labelledby="StoryIntro">
    <h2 id="StoryIntro" class="visually-hidden">About Paavai Jewellery</h2>
    <p class="story-intro__lead">
      PAAVAI JEWELLERY was founded on a simple yet profound belief: that fine jewellery
      should carry deep emotional meaning, cultural heritage, and personal pride&mdash;not
      just shine.
    </p>
    <p class="story-intro__body">
      Born out of a deep reverence for South Indian goldsmithing, Paavai bridges the gap
      between sacred, time-honored temple heirlooms and the modern bride&rsquo;s desire for
      versatile, certified luxury. Every necklace, haram, choker, and bridal set in our
      house is hand-finished by master artisans whose skills have been passed down across
      generations.
    </p>

    {%- if page.content != blank -%}
      <div class="story-intro__body rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ============ PILLARS OF EXCELLENCE ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-timeline" aria-labelledby="StoryPillars">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="story-timeline__head">
        <p class="pv-eyebrow">What we stand on</p>
        <h2 id="StoryPillars" class="story-section__title">Our Pillars of Excellence</h2>
      </header>

      <ul class="story-timeline__list story-timeline__list--pillars">
        <li class="story-marker story-marker--pillar">
          <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
            {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'award', size: 22 -%}
          </span>
          <h3 class="story-marker__title">Artisanal Heritage</h3>
          <p class="story-marker__text">
            From hand-carved Nakshi motifs depicting Goddess Lakshmi and graceful peacocks
            to intricate Jadau, Polki, and Victorian antique emerald drops, our designs pay
            homage to India&rsquo;s richest artistic traditions.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="story-marker story-marker--pillar">
          <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
            {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'shield', size: 22 -%}
          </span>
          <h3 class="story-marker__title">100% Certified Purity</h3>
          <p class="story-marker__text">
            We believe beauty starts with trust. Every single piece is crafted using 100%
            BIS Hallmarked Gold (18KT &amp; 22KT) and certified gemstones, ensuring complete
            peace of mind.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="story-marker story-marker--pillar">
          <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
            {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'refresh', size: 22 -%}
          </span>
          <h3 class="story-marker__title">Complete Transparency</h3>
          <p class="story-marker__text">
            No hidden fees or surprises. We provide itemized making charges, live gold rate
            locking options, and a Lifetime Buyback &amp; Exchange Guarantee on all our
            creations.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ============ FROM ATELIER TO HEIRLOOM ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-section container" aria-labelledby="StoryAtelier">
    <header class="story-atelier__head">
      <p class="pv-eyebrow">How a piece is made</p>
      <h2 id="StoryAtelier" class="story-section__title">From Our Atelier to Your Family Heirloom</h2>
      <p class="story-atelier__lede">
        A Paavai piece does not begin in a factory; it begins with a hand-drawn sketch
        inspired by South Indian temple architecture, natural flora, and royal heritage.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="story-timeline__list">
      <li class="story-marker">
        <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'gem', size: 22 -%}
        </span>
        <h3 class="story-marker__title">Selection</h3>
        <p class="story-marker__text">
          Uncut diamonds, natural emeralds, rubies, and South Sea pearls are individually
          hand-picked for clarity and color.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="story-marker">
        <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'hammer', size: 22 -%}
        </span>
        <h3 class="story-marker__title">Craftsmanship</h3>
        <p class="story-marker__text">
          Master goldsmiths spend dozens of hours hand-pouring gold, setting stones, and
          carving fine details.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="story-marker">
        <span class="story-marker__dot" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- render 'paavai-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 22 -%}
        </span>
        <h3 class="story-marker__title">Hallmarking &amp; Certification</h3>
        <p class="story-marker__text">
          Every completed piece undergoes strict quality checks and official hallmarking
          before it enters our collection.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ============ A NOTE TO OUR PATRONS ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-quote" aria-labelledby="StoryPatrons">
    <div class="container story-quote__inner">
      <p class="pv-eyebrow">A Note to Our Patrons</p>
      <h2 id="StoryPatrons" class="visually-hidden">A note to our patrons</h2>
      <blockquote class="story-quote__body">
        <p>
          When you wear a piece from Paavai, you are not just wearing gold&mdash;you are
          wearing hours of devotion, centuries of tradition, and a memory waiting to be
          created. We design each creation so that it becomes a cherished part of your
          story today, before it becomes a prized heirloom for the next generation.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="story-quote__attrib">Paavai Jewellery</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ============ CLOSING CTA ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="story-cta">
    <div class="container story-cta__inner">
      <h2 class="story-cta__title">Come and see the work</h2>
      <p class="story-cta__text">
        Book a consultation at the flagship, or have a piece brought to you on video.
        No obligation, and no pressure to buy on the day.
      </p>
      <div class="story-cta__actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn--gold">Book a consultation</a>
        <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="btn btn--outline-light">Browse the collection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
